With treats, a shop can be looted in no more than, say, 30 turns. If
you don't have treats, your third or fourth store will take forever,
enough for your kitten starting to yowl, even though you can pray to
get stuffed.

Mimics aren't dangerous, I even kinda like to find one when doing the
racket with a wizard, so my pet can eat a little. They are slow,
you'll be out of the shop before it can land a second blow, and go
back when your pet can take it down.

